From 89434949d51104c8363111d23dcdaf22e7d499ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yongkyun Shin <yongkyuns@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Jan 2026 20:08:04 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Add ESP32-S3 camera driver for OV3660 sensor

- Add camera driver using LCD_CAM peripheral for capture
- Support OV3660 (3MP) sensor with 16-bit register addressing
- Use SCCB bit-banging for sensor communication
- Configure 8-bit parallel interface with proper signal polarity
- Implement DMA-based frame capture with byte counting fallback
- Add Kconfig option CONFIG_ESP32S3_CAMERA
- Initialize camera in bringup for Freenove ESP32-S3-WROOM CAM

Tested with QVGA RGB565 capture (~158KB frames).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
